This C program reads moisture levels from a DFRobot Soil Moisture Sensor v2.0 using an MCP3008 ADC connected to the SPI0 hardware bus on a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B. It samples the sensor once per second, logs the raw 10-bit ADC value (0-1023) to the console with a timestamp, and handles errors for SPI initialization and transfer failures. The program also supports graceful shutdown when receiving SIGINT or SIGTERM signals.

