This C program initializes the GPIO and SPI interfaces on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+, reads the digital output from the AZDelivery KY-026 Flame Sensor Module, and routes the analog output to the MCP3008 ADC. It logs the timestamp, flame detection status, and approximated temperature to a CSV file every second. It handles errors by skipping the entry and printing a diagnostic message if the sensor is absent or any SPI or file operation fails. All resources are released on normal exit or when a SIGINT is received.

