This C program reads temperature data from a TMP36 sensor using an MCP3208 ADC on a Raspberry Pi 5. It initializes the SPI device and GPIO lines, performs a conversion at 1 Hz, validates the ADC reading, converts it to a Celsius temperature, and logs each sample to a CSV file. It also handles errors, signal handling for SIGINT and SIGTERM, and releases resources on all exit paths.

