This C program interfaces with a Honeywell SpiroQuant A+ ES1-005 Mass Flow Sensor using an MCP3008 ADC on SPI0. It initializes the driver library, opens the SPI device, reads the ADC, converts the value to a flow rate, validates the flow rate, logs the measurement with a timestamp, and handles errors appropriately. It also ensures proper cleanup on exit paths.

