This program continuously monitors the Sharp IR distance sensor using the ADS1115 ADC on the I2C bus, samples the ADC every 200 ms after an initial calibration phase, energizes a relay connected to GPIO17 when the distance reading falls below a calibrated threshold for 3 seconds, and logs the state of a magnetic reed door sensor to a log file. It handles errors, releases resources, and exits cleanly on receipt of SIGINT or SIGTERM.

