This C program reads two potentiometers through an MCP3008 ADC on SPI channel 0, maps each reading to a speed value, and controls two Adafruit Mini DC Motors using PWM and GPIO pins. It includes error handling for SPI and GPIO operations, and gracefully handles cases where a potentiometer is absent or the SPI bus reports an error. The program also cleans up all resources on normal exit or when receiving SIGINT or SIGTERM.

