This C program reads data from a Texas Instruments IWR1443 mmWave radar over UART, decodes the range profile data, checks for targets within a 1.0-meter distance threshold, logs intrusion events, and activates an LED for 2 seconds upon detection. It handles UART initialization errors, validates I/O operations, manages sensor-absent or bus-error conditions, and ensures clean release of resources on every exit path by handling SIGINT and SIGTERM signals.

