This C program continuously reads distance data from a Melexis MLX75030 Time-of-Flight sensor on I2C bus 1 at a 100 ms sampling interval. It handles errors such as sensor absence, bus errors, or read/write timeouts, implements retry logic for transient errors, logs any errors to stderr, and ensures clean resource release on all exit paths, including graceful termination when receiving SIGINT or SIGTERM.

