This C program continuously samples temperature from a Sensirion STS30-DIS sensor connected to the I2C bus 1 on a Raspberry Pi Zero W. It writes the measurement command, waits for the conversion, reads the response, validates the CRC-8 checksum, and logs the successful readings with timestamps to `enclosure_temp_log.txt`. Errors are logged to `error_log.txt`, and the program handles SIGINT to perform a graceful shutdown.

