This C program interfaces with a Sensirion SCD40 CO₂ sensor over I²C bus 1 on a Raspberry Pi Zero W. It initializes the sensor, starts periodic measurement, waits for data to be ready, reads the data, verifies the CRC, extracts the CO₂ value, temperature, and humidity, and logs the data in CSV format with a timestamp. It handles errors, retries, and SIGINT signal to ensure proper cleanup.

