This C program continuously reads temperature and humidity from a Sensirion SHT35 sensor connected to the I2C bus 1 on a Raspberry Pi Zero W. It logs the readings to a CSV file named `environment.csv` with an ISO-8601 timestamp, temperature in Celsius, and relative humidity in percent. It validates CRC-8 checksums and handles errors appropriately. The program also installs a SIGINT/SIGTERM handler for clean shutdown.

