This C program reads temperature and humidity from an Adafruit Si7021 sensor on the I2C bus of a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B. It validates the sensor presence at startup, retries I2C transactions up to three times, logs each reading to a file named `environment.log` in CSV format, and handles signals to clean up resources properly.

