This C program continuously monitors the air-duct pressure using the Sensirion SDP810-500Pa differential pressure sensor on the I2C bus. It reads the sensor data every second, validates the I2C read and write operations, and checks the CRC-8 for each part of the 9-byte result. Successful samples are logged to a file named `hvac_pressure_log.txt` in CSV format, and any errors are logged with the timestamp. The program handles SIGINT (Ctrl+C) by cleaning up resources and exiting gracefully.

