This C program continuously monitors two IR obstacle sensors connected to GPIO17 and GPIO18 on a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B. It checks for a stall condition when both sensors read LOW (0) for at least 2 seconds and logs the timestamped stall events to a file named `stall_log.txt`. The program handles errors, releases resources on exit paths, and gracefully handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals.

