This C program continuously reads the ambient light level from a BH1750 I2C light sensor and scales the brightness of an APA102 LED strip proportionally to the measured illumination. It handles errors for I/O operations, sensor-absent scenarios, and bus errors. On receipt of SIGINT, it gracefully turns off all LEDs and closes every opened file descriptor.

