This C program continuously reads ambient light from a VEML7700 sensor, applies gamma-corrected scaling to determine brightness, and drives a WS2812B LED strip by bit-banging GPIO18. It handles I2C communication errors, retries up to three times, and installs signal handlers for graceful shutdown.

