This C program fulfills the requirements by monitoring a PIR motion sensor on GPIO 4, activating a relay-controlled 12V LED floodlight on GPIO 17 for 60 seconds on each rising edge, logging activation and deactivation events with timestamps and durations, and handling errors and cleanup on all exit paths. It also installs a SIGINT/SIGTERM handler to ensure the floodlight is turned off and resources are released cleanly.

