This C program initializes the MPR121 capacitive touch sensor on I2C bus 1, configures it according to the documentation, and toggles a relay connected to GPIO17 (BCM) on a fresh rising edge touch of electrode 0 with a 200 ms debounce. It includes robust error handling for every driver library and I2C call, and ensures the relay is turned off on shutdown.

