This C program uses the libgpiod library to monitor an HC-SR501 PIR sensor on GPIO 17 and control an electric door strike relay on GPIO 18. It logs events to a file named `door_events.log` and handles rate limiting to prevent repeated unlocking. The program is designed to be single-threaded and non-blocking, with a 50 ms polling interval. It properly initializes and cleans up resources, and handles errors gracefully.

